Annex 8 Provisions regarding the approval of ﬂexible hoses with couplings
Scope
The purpose of this annex is to determine the provisions regarding the approval of flexible hoses for use with
LPG, having an inside diameter up to 20 mm.
This annex covers four types of flexible hoses:
(a) High pressure rubber hoses (Class 1, e.g. Filling hose);
(b) Low pressure rubber hoses (Class 2);
(c) High pressure synthetic hoses (Class 1);
(d) High pressure synthetic hoses (Class 0).

